### Koins Backend - Testes de Autenticação
### Use a extensão REST Client no VSCode ou Postman

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@email = teste@example.com
@password = Teste123!

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1. Cadastro (Signup)
# @name signup
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teste User",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "phone": "+5511999999999",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "partnerEmail": "parceiro@example.com"
}

### 2. Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 3. Refresh Token
# Primeiro faça login e copie o refreshToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "COLE_O_REFRESH_TOKEN_AQUI"
}

### 4. Esqueci a Senha
# @name forgotPassword
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}"
}

### 5. Resetar Senha
# Primeiro faça forgot-password e copie o token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI",
  "password": "NovaSenha123!"
}

### 6. Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

### Testes de Validação

### Cadastro com email inválido
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teste",
  "email": "email-invalido",
  "password": "Teste123!"
}

### Cadastro com senha fraca
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teste",
  "email": "novo@example.com",
  "password": "123"
}

### Login com credenciais erradas
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "SenhaErrada123!"
}

### Cadastro com email já existente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Outro Nome",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Reset de senha com token inválido
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "token-invalido",
  "password": "NovaSenha123!"
}

